illegally reportings of late payments, payment history, and everything that is provided on my report that is inaccurate and that i did not consent them to report! under 15usc1681b permissible purpose of consumer reports, THE LAW CLEARLY STATES : ( a ) IN GENERAL Subject to subsection ( c ) any consumer reporting agency may furnish a consumer report under the following circumstances and no other : ( 2 ) In accordance with the written instructions of the consumer to whom it relates.

Did I give you written instructions to furnish this account on my credit report?

Furthermore, the FAIR CREDIT REPORTING ACT 15 USC 1681 ( 2 ) ( a ) G ) Exclusions from a consumer credit report clearly states : ( 2 ) EXCLUSIONS.-Except as provided in paragraph ( 3 ), the term " consumer report '' does not include- ( A ) Subject to section 1681s-3 of this title, any ( i ) report containing information solely as to transactions or experiences between the consumer and the person making the report ;

